OL,3,GNEWSAArrest as man killed in HGV and
OL,4,Abike collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested after a man
OL,7,Fin his 80s was killed in a collision
OL,8,Fbetween an HGV and a bicycle in
OL,9,FBromsgrove.
OL,11,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said
OL,12,Fthey were called to the junction of New
OL,13,FRoad and the A38 at 15:34 BST on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,F"On arrival, a man, the cyclist, was
OL,17,Ffound. Sadly, it quickly became
OL,18,Fapparent nothing could be done to save
OL,19,Fhim and he was confirmed dead at the
OL,20,Fscene," a West Midlands Ambulance
OL,21,FService spokeswoman said.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
