OL,3,GNEWSAArrest as man killed in HGV and
OL,4,Abike collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 35-year-old woman was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of causing death by careless
OL,8,Fdriving, West Mercia Police said. She
OL,9,Fhas since been released under
OL,10,Finvestigation and was helping with
OL,11,Finquiries.
